{"id":"595661a381","t":"Supreme Demon of Hyungsan","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/1461235074919787974-193x278.jpeg","n":53,"l":53,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan"},"u":1795038339196,"desc":"حوصر مئة طفل على جبل هينغ، ولم يُعثر إلا على قلة منهم، من بينهم فتى يُدعى دان هيون وو. نجا من الجحيم الذي صنعته تشون جي جا، واكتسب في المقابل قوةً لا تُوصف إلا بالشيطانية. لكن العالم بدأ غريبًا، وقوانينه بلا معنى… لذا أصبح محاربًا مرافقًا في وكالة مرافقة خنان، يُعيد بناء معنى الإنسانية وجوهر هذا العالم من الصفر. كل ما يفعله له هدف واحد لا غير: اليوم الذي سينتقم فيه من تشون جي جا.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","خيال","دموى","صقل","فنون قتاليه","قوة خارقة","وبيتون"],"src":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/1/"},"2":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/2/"},"3":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/3/"},"4":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/4/"},"5":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/5/"},"6":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/6/"},"7":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/7/"},"8":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/8/"},"9":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/9/"},"10":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/10/"},"11":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/11/"},"12":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/12/"},"13":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/13/"},"14":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/14/"},"15":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/15/"},"16":{"ml":"supreme-demon-of-hyungsan|/manga/supreme-demon-of-hyungsan/16/"},"17":{"ml":"supreme-demon